        | 1      | free@example.com | FREE    | 無      |
        | 2      | pro@example.com  | PRO_199 | active |
      And 系統中有以下綠界金流設定：                    # tests/features/steps/ecpay/aggregate_given/ecpay_config.py:6
        | 設定         | 值                |
        | MerchantID | 3002607          |
        | HashKey    | pwFHCqoQZGmho4w6 |
        | HashIV     | EkRm7iFT261dpevs |
        | 環境         | Stage (測試)       |
      And 目前時間為 "2026-03-26 10:00:00"      # tests/features/steps/ecpay/aggregate_given/current_time.py:10
      When 未認證用戶發送建立付款訂單請求，目標方案為 "PRO_199" # tests/features/steps/ecpay/commands/create_order_unauthenticated.py:6
      Then 操作失敗，錯誤為「未認證，請先登入」              # tests/features/steps/common_then/failure_with_error.py:4
      And HTTP 狀態碼應為 401                   # tests/features/steps/ecpay/readmodel_then/http_status.py:6

