  Rule: 後置（安全）- CheckMacValue 計算應符合綠界 SHA256 規範  # tests/features/08a-綠界金流串接.feature:71

    Example: CheckMacValue 計算結果與綠界官方範例一致                                               # tests/features/08a-綠界金流串接.feature:73
      Given 系統中有以下使用者帳號：                                                               # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/users.py:64
        | 使用者 ID | Email            | 訂閱方案    | 訂閱狀態   |
        | 1      | free@example.com | FREE    | 無      |
        | 2      | pro@example.com  | PRO_199 | active |
      And 系統中有以下綠界金流設定：                                                                # tests/features/steps/ecpay/aggregate_given/ecpay_config.py:6
        | 設定         | 值                |
        | MerchantID | 3002607          |
        | HashKey    | pwFHCqoQZGmho4w6 |
        | HashIV     | EkRm7iFT261dpevs |
        | 環境         | Stage (測試)       |
      And 目前時間為 "2026-03-26 10:00:00"                                                  # tests/features/steps/ecpay/aggregate_given/current_time.py:10
      Given 以下綠界交易參數：                                                                  # tests/features/steps/ecpay/aggregate_given/ecpay_params.py:6
        | 欄位                | 值                            |
        | MerchantID        | 3002607                      |
        | MerchantTradeNo   | TEST20260326100000           |
        | MerchantTradeDate | 2026/03/26 10:00:00          |
        | TotalAmount       | 199                          |
        | TradeDesc         | Test                         |
        | ItemName          | TestItem                     |
        | PaymentType       | aio                          |
        | ChoosePayment     | ALL                          |
        | EncryptType       | 1                            |
        | ReturnURL         | https://example.com/callback |
      When 系統以 HashKey "pwFHCqoQZGmho4w6" 和 HashIV "EkRm7iFT261dpevs" 計算 CheckMacValue # tests/features/steps/ecpay/commands/calculate_mac.py:9
      Then 計算流程應為：                                                                     # tests/features/steps/ecpay/readmodel_then/mac_calculation.py:8
        """
        1. 將參數依照 key 名稱升冪排序
        2. 前綴 HashKey=，後綴 &HashIV=
        3. URL Encode（小寫）
        4. SHA256 後轉大寫
        """
      And 結果應為有效的 64 字元大寫十六進位字串                                                        # tests/features/steps/ecpay/readmodel_then/mac_calculation.py:15

  Rule: 後置（安全）- 回呼端點必須驗證 CheckMacValue 防止偽造  # tests/features/08a-綠界金流串接.feature:98

