      Then 使用者 "free@example.com" 的訂閱方案應更新為 "PRO_199"   # tests/features/steps/subscription_upgrade/aggregate_then/subscription_updated.py:18
      And 使用者 "free@example.com" 的訂閱狀態應更新為 "active"     # tests/features/steps/subscription_upgrade/aggregate_then/subscription_updated.py:33
      And 使用者 "free@example.com" 的每日 AI 對話限額應從 3 提升至 30 # tests/features/steps/subscription_upgrade/aggregate_then/quota_upgrade.py:36
      And 使用者 "free@example.com" 的每月上傳限額應從 5 提升至 50     # tests/features/steps/subscription_upgrade/aggregate_then/quota_upgrade.py:48
      And 使用者 "free@example.com" 的每月考試限額應從 10 提升至 100   # tests/features/steps/subscription_upgrade/aggregate_then/quota_upgrade.py:60

