      Then 營運儀表板應顯示紅色警報卡片，內容為「Worker 失敗率異常：8%」  # tests/features/steps/admin/readmodel_then/alert_card.py:6
      And 系統應發送 Email 通知至所有 admin 與 super_admin # tests/features/steps/admin/aggregate_then/email_notify_admins.py:6

