        | 次序 | 分數 |
        | 1  | 75 |
        | 2  | 68 |
        | 3  | 55 |
      Given 今日為 2026-03-25                           # tests/features/steps/schedule/aggregate_given/today_date.py:8
      And 使用者 "alice@example.com" 的最後登入日為 2026-03-20 # tests/features/steps/community/aggregate_given/last_login.py:11
      When 系統執行低谷偵測排程                                # tests/features/steps/community/commands/run_valley_detection.py:6
      Then 系統應發送 Email 通知至 "alice@example.com"       # tests/features/steps/community/readmodel_then/email_sent.py:6
      And Email 標題應包含使用者顯示名稱                         # tests/features/steps/community/readmodel_then/email_title.py:6
      And Email 語氣應為溫馨風格，不含施壓或貶低用語                   # tests/features/steps/community/readmodel_then/email_tone.py:9

